WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.020 --> 00:00:04.050
The James Webb Space Telescope is the next

2
00:00:04.070 --> 00:00:08.120
premier space observatory. 

3
00:00:08.140 --> 00:00:12.190
It will extend the discoveries of the Hubble Space

4
00:00:12.210 --> 00:00:16.290
Telescope. 

5
00:00:16.310 --> 00:00:20.420
And observe the birthplaces of planets, stars

6
00:00:20.440 --> 00:00:24.590
and galaxies.

7
00:00:24.610 --> 00:00:28.680
It is named after James Webb. NASA's second administrator and champion

8
00:00:28.700 --> 00:00:32.850
of many NASA science missions.

9
00:00:32.870 --> 00:00:37.030
At 3 stories high and the size of a tennis court,

10
00:00:37.050 --> 00:00:41.210
his will be the largest telescope ever sent into space.

11
00:00:41.230 --> 00:00:45.380
And 100 times more powerful than Hubble.

12
00:00:45.400 --> 00:00:49.570
It is so big it has to fold to fit in the

13
00:00:49.590 --> 00:00:53.760
rocket only 5.5 meters wide.

14
00:00:53.780 --> 00:00:57.940
And unfold segment by segment, once in space.

15
00:00:57.960 --> 00:01:02.050
Webb's mirrors are coated with a super

16
00:01:02.070 --> 00:01:06.230
thin layer of gold that is about 1000 atoms thick to optimize

17
00:01:06.250 --> 00:01:10.410
their reflectivity in the infrared. Webb will launch

18
00:01:10.430 --> 00:01:14.610
from French Guiana.

19
00:01:14.630 --> 00:01:18.690
It is launched near the equator taking advantage of Earth's greater rotation

20
00:01:18.710 --> 00:01:22.760
speed there to boost launch performance.

21
00:01:22.780 --> 00:01:26.960
Webb will orbit the sun 1 million miles from Earth at

22
00:01:26.980 --> 00:01:31.080
the second Sun-Earth Lagrange point. The telescope

23
00:01:31.100 --> 00:01:35.220
will observe infrared light with unprecedented sensitivity.

24
00:01:35.240 --> 00:01:39.420
It will see the first galaxies born after the Big Bang 

25
00:01:39.440 --> 00:01:43.610
over 13.5 billion years ago.

26
00:01:43.630 --> 00:01:47.810
Webb's infrared cameras are so sensitive

27
00:01:47.830 --> 00:01:51.980
 they must block light from the Sun, Earth, and Moon.

28
00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:56.170
The 5-layer sunshield is like having sunblock

29
00:01:56.190 --> 00:02:00.240
of SPF 1 million.

30
00:02:00.260 --> 00:02:04.320
music

31
00:02:04.340 --> 00:02:08.390
music

32
00:02:08.410 --> 00:02:12.580
music

33
00:02:12.600 --> 00:02:16.650
Webb is an international mission

34
00:02:16.670 --> 00:02:20.690
with contributions from the European Space Agency

35
00:02:20.710 --> 00:02:24.760
 and Canadian Space Agency.

36
00:02:24.780 --> 00:02:28.820
Scientists all over the world

37
00:02:28.840 --> 00:02:32.870
will be able to use Webb

38
00:02:32.890 --> 00:02:36.910
to explore further into space and back

39
00:02:36.930 --> 00:02:41.050
into time. 

40
00:02:41.070 --> 00:02:45.230
beeps

41
00:02:45.250 --> 00:02:46.246
beeps
